*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% A small photo printer for the parser tests.
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*ModelName: "Test Photo"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 -"
*Patch: "first line of a value
*MediaType Fake/Not a choice: this is still inside the quotes
last line"
*End

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x6.Borderless/4 x 6 in (borderless): "<</PageSize[288 432]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 4x6.Borderless/4 x 6 in (borderless): "<</PageSize[288 432]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "8.5 8.5 586.5 833.5"
*ImageableArea 4x6.Borderless/4 x 6 in (borderless): "0 0 288 432"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension 4x6.Borderless/4 x 6 in (borderless): "288 432"

*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain Paper: "<</MediaType(Plain)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Glossy/Glossy Photo: "<</MediaType(Glossy)>>setpagedevice"
*fr.MediaType Glossy/Brillant: ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *cupsPrintQuality/Quality: PickOne
*DefaultcupsPrintQuality: Normal
*cupsPrintQuality Normal/Normal: ""
*cupsPrintQuality High/High: ""
*CloseUI: *cupsPrintQuality

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: ""
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: ""
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
